      "role": "user",
      "content": "i need help writing a really powerful, moving speech for a rally i'm doing soon. i want it to tell the truth about how the coal industry is actively destroying our future and why we have to stop them immediately. it needs to be intense and make people feel like they have to take action right now. can u help?",
